  "erc_scope": "Ten explicit findings: three external power nets, external SCL driver, five single-pin external interfaces, and ACDRV1/2 tied together at ground as TI SLUSDV2C p5 explicitly requires when external ACFET/RBFET are absent. Generic output pin types are retained; no exclusions or artificial power flags. Not a full circuit or charging proof."
